<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n34734" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">per-cŏquo</span></b> , xi, ctum, 3,
			v. a., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>to boil</i> or <i>cook
			thoroughly</i>, <i>boil soft.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">prandium,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plaut. Merc. 3, 3, 18</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">bubulas carnes,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					23, 7, 64, § 127</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">lens non bene percocta,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					22, 25, 70, § 142</span></i>
			.—Prov.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">In digitis hodie percoquam quod ceperit,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plaut. Rud. 4, 1, 11</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<i>To heat</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">umorem,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Lucr.
					6, 858</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">terram,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					5, 1254</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<i>To ripen</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">mora percoquit uvas,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. R. Am. 83</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sol percoquit fructus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sen. Ben. 7, 31, 3</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">messem,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					Ep. 5, 6, 8</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>C.</b>
			<i>To scorch</i>, <i>to blacken</i> by
			the heat of the sun: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">nigra virum percocto saecla colore,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Lucr.
					6, 722</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
